                "type": "query",
                "description": "The bitrate (kbps)\n|Possible values|\n|:-|\n| `8`,`16`,`24`,`32`,`40`,`48`,`56`,`64`,`80`,`96`,`112`,`128`,`144`,`160`|"
              },
              {
                "name": "sampleRate",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Sample Rates, in Hz.\n\n|Possible values|\n|:-|\n|`22050`, `24000`, `16000`|"
